(and (equal? c1 '<) (equal? c2 '>))" :tags (program))) :invariant "∀ x y ∈ ℝ. compare(x,y) = '< ⇔ compare(y,x) = '>" :meta "Antisymmetry of the order relation. If broken, the ordering is being conflated. See book-of-math ch 8."
