        (if (equal? (math/compare (car xs) pivot) '<)
            (loop (cdr xs) (cons (car xs) less) more)
            (loop (cdr xs) less (cons (car xs) more))))))
(partition 5 '(3 8 1 9 4))" :tags (composition))) :emergent "ordering-partition: compare drives a bipartition." :meta "Belongs to the family of divide-and-conquer partition patterns. See book-of-composition ch 7."
